<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .contact-info {
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .logo-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 40px 0 30px 0;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <p>From: <span data-field="sender.name">{{ sender.name }}</span></p>
      <p>Sent: <span data-field="sender.date">{{ sender.date }}</span></p>
      <p>To: <span data-field="recipient.name">{{ recipient.name }}</span></p>
      <p>Subject: <span data-field="subject">{{ subject }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="logo-container">
      <div class="logo" style="background-color: #000; width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-size: 30px; color: white;">W</div>
      <div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">WESTERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px;">Faculty Senate</h2>
        <h3 style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px;">Senate Snapshot</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 22px; margin-top: 30px;">Mental Health Forum</h2>

  <p>Dear colleagues:</p>

  <p>As we close in on the end of spring semester, first let me thank you for your sustained commitment to our students and to Western Michigan University. The critically important work you do results in our students, faculty and excellent programs making state and national news. Thank-you! Let's also congratulate the <span data-field="organization.name">{{ organization.name }}</span> and the <span data-field="organization.name2">{{ organization.name2 }}</span> for their successful Mental Health Week culminating with a student mental health summit last Thursday night.</p>

  <p>There has been on-going and more frequent conversation about mental health concerns on our campus. Following up on the last weeks Mental Health Summit, several faculty members have suggested additional conversation. The next opportunity to discuss this important topic will be <span data-field="event.date">{{ event.date }}</span>, at <span data-field="event.time">{{ event.time }}</span> in <span data-field="location.name">{{ location.name }}</span>, Rooms <span data-field="location.room_number">{{ location.room_number }}</span>. This will be a time for faculty and staff to discuss what we are experiencing in our own lives and what we are seeing in student interactions. We can also discuss how we can collectively work together and support each other. Co-sponsored by the Faculty Senate, WSA, and GSA, the forum will be open to all campus members regardless of affiliation.</p>

  <p>We invite you to join us for this event. Feel free to mask up, as masks are always appropriate. Thank-you for what you do each and every day. We look forward to seeing you next week.</p>

  <p>Sincerely,</p>

  <p>Marilyn S. Kritzman</p>
  <p><span data-field="sender.title">{{ sender.title }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="sender.department">{{ sender.department }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="sender.institution">{{ sender.institution }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="logo-container">
        <div class="logo" style="background-color: #000; width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-size: 30px; color: white;">W</div>
        <div>
          <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">WESTERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
          <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px;">Faculty Senate</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-info">
        <p>4060 Moore Hall</p>
        <p>1903 W. Michigan Ave.</p>
        <p>Ph: <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span></p>
        <p>Email: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
        <p>Web: <span data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.8em;">Page 2</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>